Oh, yeh!

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:10.860
Hello everybody, my name is Markiplier

00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:13.380
and welcome to "We Become What We Behold".

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:15.860
This is made by the same creator of :the game:,

00:00:15.860 --> 00:00:21.680
You may remember :the game: from a while ago; it was a Flash animated-style game about MEMES and such,

00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:24.380
back when they weren't actually MEMES and such,

00:00:24.820 --> 00:00:26.720
