00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:35.320
Here's what happen- What happened in 2008?

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:36.220
I have no goddamn idea.

00:00:36.440 --> 00:00:39.160
Ohh, that's right, the financial crisis,

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:40.460
that's what the game was all about!

00:00:40.460 --> 00:00:42.980
If you wanna know about the game, I'll put a link in the description.

00:00:43.180 --> 00:00:45.180
It was great, I loved it a lot.

00:00:45.180 --> 00:00:47.300
Uh, but this is a short, five minute-
*squeaker sound*

00:00:47.840 --> 00:00:48.740
...adventure about...

00:00:49.280 --> 00:00:49.780
..something.

00:00:49.780 --> 00:00:55.620
"We become what we behold, we shape our tools and then our tools shape us."

00:00:55.900 --> 00:00:58.920
